atest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "8638869799464805"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "710309429649470"}]}, "change_log": "Update 2.1 is now available for VRIT \ud83d\udcaa\nHere are the patch notes :\n\n- Added a warning on the startup screen if hand tracking is disabled\n- Improved the slider buttons\n- Improved the Crossbody Toe Touch animation during warmup\n- Reworked the \"shoot\" animation in the Run rules\n- Added a mention of the \"hand closed\" gesture in the Run rules\n- Improved the stretching music mix", "created_date": 1681399991, "id": "6384735771544897", "version": "2.1", "version_code": 34, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}